@sellerToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InRlc3Qtc2VsbGVyLWlkLTAxIiwiZW1haWwiOiJzZWxsZXJAdGVzdC5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoiU0VMTEVSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzM1Njg5NjAwLCJleHAiOjIwNTEwNDk2MDB9.b72ElQl5zvPQjAf-hhgvQNtv422HtcPjvT5qQ3EPeM0
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InRlc3QtYWRtaW4taWQtMDEiLCJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQHRlc3QuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IkFETUlOIiwiaWF0IjoxNzM1Njg5NjAwLCJleHAiOjIwNTEwNDk2MDB9.sD-JpVjXOUG4buIUZHoT5s8Xc6bx748qVnx0eXyTcEg

# 시드 데이터의 고정 ID (customer)
@userId = test-customer-id-01

# 클래스/슬롯/예약 생성 시 자동으로 채워짐
@classId = {{createClass.response.body.data.id}}
@slotId = {{createSlot.response.body.data.id}}
@reservationId = {{createReservation.response.body.data.id}}

### 0. [공통] 내 정보 조회 (ID 확인용)
# @name profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 1. [고객] 포인트 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 2. [고객] 포인트 충전 (10,000P)
POST {{baseUrl}}/points/charge
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "amount": 10000,
  "paymentKey": "test_payment_key_{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "orderId": "test_order_id_{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 3. [고객] 포인트 내역 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me/history?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 4. [고객] 포인트 내역 조회 (충전만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me/history?type=CHARGE
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. [관리자] 포인트 지급 

POST {{baseUrl}}/points/admin/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 5000,
  "memo": "이벤트 참여 보상"
}

### 6. [관리자] 포인트 차감 
POST {{baseUrl}}/points/admin/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": -1000,
  "memo": "관리자 차감 테스트"
}

### 7. [관리자] 전체 포인트 내역 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/admin/history?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. [판매자] 매출 정산 요약 (2026년 2월)
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/seller/settlement?year=2026&month=2
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 9. [판매자] 거래 내역 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/seller/transactions?year=2026&month=2&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 10. [준비] 클래스 생성 (환불 테스트용)
# @name createClass
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

포인트테스트용클래스
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

필라테스
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="level"

초급
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

포인트 환불 테스트를 위한 클래스입니다
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePoints"

3000
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="capacity"

5
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 10-1. [준비] 클래스 승인
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10-2. [준비] 슬롯 생성
# @name createSlot
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

{
  "date": "2026-03-30",
  "hour": 17,
  "capacity": 5,
  "isOpen": true
}

### 10-3. [고객] 예약 생성 (환불 테스트용)
# @name createReservation

POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}"
}

### 11. [고객] 예약 취소 (환불 발생)
# 위 요청에서 생성된 reservationId 필요
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "단순 변심"
}

### 12. [판매자] 클래스 삭제 (환불 발생)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 13. [고객] 포인트 내역 조회 (환불만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me/history?type=REFUND
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
